# Text files keep LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says: the
# builds read some of them as they are (the strings, the shaders, the plist).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows' own scripts, with Windows' line endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Images, icons, ROMs and assembled demos.
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
